    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Review Pulse – 0 Orchestrator\n**Every Monday, hourly 08:00–12:00 IST.** GitHub collects reviews at 07:00.\n\n1. Waits until `ingest_log` says **done** for last week.\n2. Runs **3b Analyse** (retries if tagging is unfinished) → **4 Draft & validate** → **5c Approve & publish** (sends you the approval email).\n3. Safe to run any number of times: a week that is already processing, awaiting approval or published is skipped.\n4. Anything wrong → the run stops and **Review Pulse – Error alert** emails you.\n\n**Manual run:** leave *Week override* blank for last week, or type e.g. `2026-W42`.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "701e60aa-1e38-4497-b4c4-bb6f5f82deb0",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -40
      ]
    }
